# A guest holds a rock still, and the host recalls it while her path to the host loses everything
# from just before the recall until after she has heard: nothing she sent of the rock under her old
# number reaches the host, so a check that her late packets were dropped must fail: whatever else
# of hers the host drops in the window (an older sample under reordering) is not the rock's.
scenario mf_recall_still
scene glass_door
seed 5
guests 1
settle 6s
net g1 rtt 100ms jitter 20ms reorder 10% reorder_delay 40ms
p1 grab rock_a as lift
p1 wait 3s
at 1900ms net g1 to_host loss 100%
at 2s p0 recall rock_a as recall
at 2200ms net g1 to_host loss 0%
expect result lift granted
expect result recall done
expect late_drops.count >= 1
